  "original_text": "Treasury Offering Announcement1                                                                                                                       Contact: Treasury Auctions [email omitted]\n\n                           Department of the Treasury | Bureau of the Fiscal Service                                                                                                               Embargoed Until: 11/12/2026 - 11:00 AM\n\n\n\n\nOFFERING DESCRIPTION                                                                                                            DATES/TIMES\nSecurity Description ..............................................................................13-Week Bill                 Noncompetitive Auction Close ............................... 11/16/2026 - 11:00 AM ET\nSecurity Term .................................................................................................. 91-Day         Competitive Auction Close ...................................... 11/16/2026 - 11:30 AM ET\nSecurity Type .......................................................................................................... Bill   Issue Date ........................................................................................... 11/19/2026\nReopening .............................................................................................................. Yes    Original Issue Date ............................................................................ 02/19/2026\nOﬀering Amount ($) .........................................................................95,000,000,000                      Maturity Date ..................................................................................... 02/18/2027\nCurrently Outstanding ($) ............................................................. 137,055,059,600\nCUSIP ......................................................................................................... 912797TV9       PARTICIPATION\n                                                                                                                                Primary Dealer Bids Accepted ....................................................................... Yes\nLIMITS                                                                                                                          Primary Dealers Inside of Oﬀering ............................................................... Yes\n                                                           2\nCompetitive Bid Rate Increments (%) ........................................................... 0.005                           Direct Participant Bids Accepted ...................................................................Yes\nMaximum Noncompetitive Award ($) ...................................................10,000,000                                  Direct Participants Inside of Oﬀering ........................................................... Yes\nMaximum Competitive Award ($) .................................................. 33,250,000,000                                 Indirect Participant Bids Accepted ................................................................ Yes\nMaximum Recognized Bid at a Single Rate ($) ............................ 33,250,000,000                                         Indirect Participants Inside of Oﬀering ........................................................ Yes\nNLP Reporting Threshold ($) .......................................................... 33,250,000,000                           SOMA Bids Accepted .......................................................................................Yes\nNLP Exclusion Amount ($) .............................................................. 42,971,563,100                          SOMA Inside of Oﬀering ..................................................................................No\nMinimum to Bid Amount ($) ...............................................................................100                    FIMA Noncompetitive Bids Accepted ............................................................Yes\n                                                                                                                                                                                            3\nMultiple to Bid Amount ($) ................................................................................. 100                FIMA Noncompetitive Inside of Oﬀering .................................................... Yes\n                                                                                                                                Eligible for Holding by Treasury Retail ......................................................... Yes\nRATES (%)                                                                                                                       Treasury Retail Inside of Oﬀering ................................................................. Yes\nHigh ...................................................................................... Determined at Auction\n                                                                                                                                PRICE\nMATURING BILL SECURITIES DETAILS                                                                                                Price per $100 ($) .......................................................... Determined at Auction\nMaturing Date ......................................................................................... 11/19/2026\nTotal Marketable Amount Outstanding ($) ................................ 282,515,363,900\nPrivate Holdings ($) ....................................................................... 262,765,328,000\nSOMA Holdings ($) ........................................................................... 19,750,035,900\n\n\n\n\n1\n  Governed by the Terms and Conditions set forth in The Uniform Oﬀering Circular for the Sale and Issue of Marketable Book-Entry Treasury Bills, Notes, and\nBonds (31 CFR Part 356, as amended), and this oﬀering announcement.\n2\n  Must be expressed as a rate with three decimals in increments of 0.005%, e.g., 7.100%, 7.105%.\n3\n  FIMA up to $2,000,000,000 in noncompetitive bids from Foreign and International Monetary Authority not to exceed $500,000,000 per account.",
  "translation_ja": "## 米財務省・財政局の入札公告［1］\n\n解禁は2026年11月12日11:00米東部時間。連絡窓口は国債入札担当。\n\n| 募集・日程 | 公告記載 |\n|---|---|\n| 銘柄・期間・種類 | 13週物短期国債（91日） |\n| 発行区分 | 再発行 |\n| 募集額 | 95,000,000,000ドル |\n| CUSIP | 912797TV9 |\n| 既発残高 | 137,055,059,600ドル |\n| 非競争入札締切 | 2026-11-16 11:00 AM 米東部時間 |\n| 競争入札締切 | 2026-11-16 11:30 AM 米東部時間 |\n| 発行日 | 2026-11-19 |\n| 当初発行日 | 2026-02-19 |\n| 償還日 | 2027-02-18 |\n\n| 入札条件 | 公告記載 |\n|---|---|\n| 競争入札の利率刻み［2］ | 0.005％ |\n| 非競争落札上限 | 10,000,000ドル |\n| 競争落札上限 | 33,250,000,000ドル |\n| 単一利率の認定入札上限 | 33,250,000,000ドル |\n| ネット・ロング・ポジション（NLP）報告基準額 | 33,250,000,000ドル |\n| NLP除外額 | 42,971,563,100ドル |\n| 最低入札額・増分 | 100ドル・100ドル |\n| 最高落札利率・額面100ドル当たり価格 | 入札時に決定 |\n\n| 参加区分 | 入札受入・保有 | 募集額の内数 |\n|---|---|---|\n| プライマリーディーラー | 可 | はい |\n| 直接参加者 | 可 | はい |\n| 間接参加者 | 可 | はい |\n| SOMA | 可 | いいえ |\n| FIMA非競争入札［3］ | 可 | はい |\n| Treasury Retail | 保有可 | はい |\n\n| 償還を迎える短期証券 | 公告記載 |\n|---|---|\n| 償還日 | 2026-11-19 |\n| 市場性証券残高計 | 282,515,363,900ドル |\n| 民間保有 | 262,765,328,000ドル |\n| SOMA保有 | 19,750,035,900ドル |\n\n［1］市場性の振替記録式米国債の売却・発行に関する統一募集要項（改正後の31 CFR Part 356）および本公告の条件が適用される。\n\n［2］利率は小数第3位まで、0.005％刻みで表示する。例は7.100％、7.105％。\n\n［3］外国・国際通貨当局（FIMA）の非競争入札は総額20億ドルまで、1口座当たり5億ドルを上限とする。",
